# Large binary / media files — must NOT be in git (causes Vercel 225 MB bundle limit breach)
# Store these in cloud storage (Google Drive, S3, etc.) instead.
Documents/*.mp4
Documents/*.mkv
Documents/*.avi
Documents/*.mov
Documents/*.pptx
Documents/*.xlsx
Documents/*.xls
Documents/*.crdownload
*.crdownload
